7200/extras/aef11566ab708ed8e3746ca1be32373a.avif?t=1760550316\" width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/55acfc5222e3e8ff2b28982317cf679a.poster.avif?t=1760550316\" width=194 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/55acfc5222e3e8ff2b28982317cf679a.webm?t=1760550316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/55acfc5222e3e8ff2b28982317cf679a.mp4?t=1760550316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/49650a78452339a4640b4e71fb28c778.avif?t=1760550316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras_big/49650a78452339a4640b4e71fb28c778.avif?t=1760550316 width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/91d384d7a7fdcddc2db1df0eb97ee856.poster.avif?t=1760550316\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/91d384d7a7fdcddc2db1df0eb97ee856.webm?t=1760550316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/91d384d7a7fdcddc2db1df0eb97ee856.mp4?t=1760550316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pitch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PARTY Basketball!</strong> is the <strong>ultimate basketball simulator</strong>. <strong>Party with friends</strong> in a <strong>fully immersive</strong> experience of <strong>Arcade eSports</strong> with a <strong>retro art style that takes you back to the 90s</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>real basketball</strong>, you really <strong>need a good hand to score a basket</strong>; it's not as simple as pressing a button. There's <strong>no statistics</strong>, the best player wins (<strong>no pay-to-win</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's designed to be played with <strong>friends</strong>, and it is also a good tool to <strong>make new friends</strong>! \u2026like Parcheesi! <strong>Share</strong> the game and see the <strong>laughs</strong>! Play <strong>LAN</strong> games with your friends while you chat about your stuff, or find someone <strong>Online</strong> to beat the shit out of and show the world who's boss. You can <strong>team up with others</strong> or <strong>play alone against them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PARTY Basketball! is a multiplayer eSports basketball video game. Team up with your friends or play against them in a variety of basketball games. Showing the world who has the best shot won't be easy because, as real basketball, you really need good hands to let the ball go in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress your character in your favorite color!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As real basketball, your hands matter to let the ball go in!!! Let it go!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play hard, trick your opponents and Dunk! ...if you can, because they won't let you.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587200?t=1760550316","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/269595880481a8b534bbf858f1547c8d4589a44d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760550316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/03ecbad25d89d12fef12b848bd6b0e9036eeaa27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760550316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/03ecbad25d89d12fef12b848bd6b0e9036eeaa27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760550316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/b3dde545d2c9c1891a1958a47e0d383e.avif?t=1760550316\" width=1560 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras/338dbbe99ec15b5306cd5dbe4b92ce12.avif?t=1760550316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/extras_big/338dbbe99ec15b5306cd5dbe4b92ce12.webp?t=1760550316 width=1560 height=522 /