ck to the 90s</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>real basketball</strong>, you really <strong>need a good hand to score a basket</strong>; it's not as simple as pressing a button. There's <strong>no statistics</strong>, the best player wins (<strong>no pay-to-win</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's designed to be played with <strong>friends</strong>, and it is also a good tool to <strong>make new friends</strong>! \u2026like Parcheesi! <strong>Share</strong> the game and see the <strong>laughs</strong>! Play <strong>LAN</strong> games with your friends while you chat about your stuff, or find someone <strong>Online</strong> to beat the shit out of and show the world who's boss. You can <strong>team up with others</strong> or <strong>play alone against them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PARTY Basketball! is a multiplayer eSports basketball video game. Team up with your friends or play against them in a variety of basketball games. Showing the world who has the best shot won't be easy because, as real basketball, you really need good hands to let the ball go in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress your character in your favorite color!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As real basketball, your hands matter to let the ball go in!!! Let it go!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play hard, trick your opponents and Dunk! ...if you can, because they won't let you.</p></li></ul>","developers":["ANIKAI Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587200/23946ee1f369d29ab4b03a31617922c40801b33a/header.jpg?t=1760550316","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</